<div class="prose"><h2>Information collection</h2><p>This website does not offer user accounts, accept form submissions, or use first-party analytics. It does not intentionally collect personal information.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>The council map loads map tiles from OpenStreetMap. Links to Google Maps, the Knights of Columbus, and the California State Council lead to external websites governed by their own privacy practices.</p><h2>Future changes</h2><p>This notice will be updated before adding analytics, contact forms, or other services that collect visitor information.</p></div>
